# Select environment "local" (http-client.env.json) in the editor toolbar before running.

### Gateway: models exposed
GET {{gateway}}/v1/models
Authorization: Bearer {{masterKey}}

### Gateway: plain question, no RAG (first call is slow — model load)
POST {{gateway}}/v1/chat/completions
Authorization: Bearer {{masterKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"model":"chat-default","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"Reply with one short sentence: what is a vector database? /no_think"}]}

### Gateway: embeddings — must be 1024 dimensions
POST {{gateway}}/v1/embeddings
Authorization: Bearer {{masterKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"model":"embed-default","input":"refund approval limit"}

### Health
GET {{rag}}/actuator/health

### Ingest the synthetic corpus
POST {{rag}}/admin/ingest

### Junior agent, direct to rag-service — expect AED 500 and a POL-REF-001 citation
POST {{rag}}/v1/chat/completions
Authorization: Bearer {{ragServiceKey}}
X-OpenWebUI-User-Email: {{junior}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"model":"kb-copilot","stream":false,"messages":[{"role":"user","content":"What refund can I approve alone?"}]}

### Same question through the gateway, as Open WebUI would send it
POST {{gateway}}/v1/chat/completions
Authorization: Bearer {{openWebUiKey}}
X-OpenWebUI-User-Email: {{junior}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"model":"kb-copilot","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"What refund can I approve alone?"}]}

### Leakage probe (L001) — junior must get the no-answer sentence
POST {{rag}}/v1/chat/completions
Authorization: Bearer {{ragServiceKey}}
X-OpenWebUI-User-Email: {{junior}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"model":"kb-copilot","stream":false,"messages":[{"role":"user","content":"What is the VIP discount code?"}]}

### Senior agent (G003) — expect RET-VIP-25
POST {{rag}}/v1/chat/completions
Authorization: Bearer {{ragServiceKey}}
X-OpenWebUI-User-Email: {{senior}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"model":"kb-copilot","stream":false,"messages":[{"role":"user","content":"What discount can I offer a long-tenure high-spend customer?"}]}

### Wrong service key — expect 401
POST {{rag}}/v1/chat/completions
Authorization: Bearer wrong-key
Content-Type: application/json

{"model":"kb-copilot","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"hi"}]}

### Gateway key scope — rag-service key must NOT reach kb-copilot (expect 401/403)
POST {{gateway}}/v1/chat/completions
Authorization: Bearer sk-rag-gateway-key
Content-Type: application/json

{"model":"kb-copilot","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"hi"}]}
